triage: fix_game: The match crashed with a CalcError when it drew from an empty deck list, which is a bug in the file. A new hand must start from all 16 cards no matter what state came before, and every draw must be guarded. The Countess failure is easy to fix in the file too: the rules force rank 7 out anyway, so offering only 7 changes nothing in play and satisfies the test.
